## Troubleshooting reference

- `ImagePullBackOff` - kubectl describe pod; check image manifest, registry, architecture; replace outdated v3 image
- `Pods Running but form does not persist` -	Check frontend Redis hostname/env settings, browser Network requests, PHP errors
- `Redis replica reports role:master` -	Set redis-server args --replicaof redis-leader 6379; rerun pulumi up
- `Prometheus port-forward says service not found` - Run kubectl -n monitoring get svc; use actual Prometheus Service name
- `Grafana panels show No data` -	Check Prometheus targets, ServiceMonitor/Probe discovery, query labels, datasource, scrape endpoints
- `localhost port unavailable` - Check port-forward terminal, choose alternate local port, verify service and Pods
- `Pulumi update fails readiness`- kubectl get events -A --sort-by=.lastTimestamp; kubectl describe deployment; inspect logs